     4	ZIP:     sha256(dist/31b-<v>.zip) == the 'zip sha256:' line of bundles/31b/<v>/MANIFEST.md.
     5	CONTENT: zip member paths + per-file sha256 == files under bundles/31b/<v>/, excluding ONLY the
     6	         root MANIFEST.md of the source dir (bin/pack strips it from the zip by design).
     7	Also records sha256 of agent.yaml inside the zip (header agent_yaml_sha256 must equal it).
     8	TRANSPORT is a separate check made at push time (journaled); it is not computed here.
     9	
    10	Usage: eval/plan009_identity.py v012 [v013 ...] [--out results/plan009_bundle_identity.json] [--event smoke|main|chunkN]
    11	Exit 0 iff every requested bundle passes ZIP and CONTENT. Appends one record per call to the output file.
    12	"""
